    "description": "Vintage Pen Collection\nChromatic Gold Tone and Blue Marbled Ballpoints\n3 Items, Mixed Vintage Styles\nThis set of writing instruments includes a classic pair of gold-tone ballpoint pens by Chromatic along with a contemporary-styled blue marbled lacquer pen. The Chromatic pens represent mid-century American office luxury, featuring slim silhouettes and textured finishes, while the blue marbled pen provides a bold, modern contrast with its rich colors and gold-tone hardware. Both sets include their original presentation cases, making them suitable for collectors or as desktop accessories.\nITEMS INCLUDED:\n1.\nChromatic Gold Tone Pen Pair\n- Matching slim ballpoint pens with textured barrels and pocket clips; includes original green velvet-lined case.\n2.\nBlue Marbled Ballpoint Pen\n- Features a deep cobalt blue lacquer finish with gold-tone trim and twist-action deployment; includes blue presentation case.\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition overall. The gold-tone Chromatic pens show light surface scratching and minor patina consistent with age and use. The green case shows shelf wear and light interior discoloration. The blue marbled pen is in excellent cosmetic condition with a smooth twist mechanism. Ink cartridges may require replacement for optimal writing performance.",
